OL,3,GNEWSA'Exceptional' search dog dies
OL,4,Amonths after retirement
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "exceptional" fire service dog that
OL,7,Fhad supported major search and rescue
OL,8,Foperations has died a few months after
OL,9,Fretiring.
OL,11,FDavey joined Lancashire Fire and Rescue
OL,12,FService (LFRS) in 2017 after being
OL,13,Frehomed from the Dogs Trust and trained
OL,14,Fto become a "highly skilled" urban
OL,15,Fsearch and rescue dog.
OL,17,FNine years of service included helping
OL,18,Fto locate survivors following
OL,19,Fearthquakes in Turkey, Morocco and
OL,20,FVenezuela, where he was part of a team
OL,21,Fthat searched 500 buildings.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
