OL,3,GNEWSA'Exceptional' search dog dies
OL,4,Amonths after retirement
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavey had been unwell for the past two
OL,7,Fweeks and, despite receiving specialist
OL,8,Fveterinary care and undergoing a number
OL,9,Fof tests, the cause of his illness
OL,10,Fcould not be established, LFRS said.
